<headroom-rig>
<metadata preset-name="Jazz Box Warmth" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A dark, round archtop clean for chord-melody and comping: a solid-state 2x12 with the bright switch off, treble rolled back and mids forward, no chorus, just a small room around it. Neck pickup, tone knob around 6-7. Stays clean and even however hard you dig in." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
