<headroom-library version="1" id="clean-jazz-box" category="Clean" order="60" instrument="guitar" style="Jazz">
  <description>A dark, round archtop clean for chord-melody and comping: a solid-state 2x12 with the bright switch off, treble rolled back and mids forward, no chorus, just a small room around it. Neck pickup, tone knob around 6-7. Stays clean and even however hard you dig in.</description>
  <tags><tag>Clean</tag><tag>Jazz</tag><tag>Warm</tag><tag>Room</tag></tags>
  <sources>
